01:26:33.621 --> 01:26:35.256
Lakuin sendiri.

01:26:36.157 --> 01:26:37.759
Coba bikin diri lu ngerasa enak sendiri.

01:26:43.865 --> 01:26:44.866
Pegang kayak gini.

01:27:04.953 --> 01:27:05.954
Enak banget.

01:27:07.956 --> 01:27:08.990
Masukin tangan lu juga.

