Dikit lagi.

01:28:46.187 --> 01:28:47.488
Gue masukin ya.

01:29:32.900 --> 01:29:46.781
Tonjolkan pantatmu. Terus gerakin.

01:29:47.515 --> 01:29:55.523
Tonjolkan pantatmu kayak gitu.

01:29:56.057 --> 01:29:57.558
Keluarin isinya.

01:29:58.259 --> 01:29:59.560
Keluarin isinya.

01:29:59.894 --> 01:30:00.361
Isinya?

