Jangan nangis.

01:30:39.500 --> 01:30:44.639
Isinya.

01:31:20.741 --> 01:31:28.182
Udah keluar.

01:31:31.819 --> 01:31:32.920
Gimana? Keluarin sendiri.

01:31:33.054 --> 01:31:34.055
Angkat pinggulmu.

01:31:42.129 --> 01:31:43.931
Keluarin isinya.

01:31:44.966 --> 01:31:48.102
Mau keluarin di perut.

01:31:51.439 --> 01:31:54.008
Keluarin di perut.

01:32:01.849 --> 01:32:08.289
Keluarin di perut. Sekarang giliran aku yang keluarin.

01:32:08.990 --> 01:32:09.991
Mau keluar nih.

01:32:10.491 --> 01:32:11.559
Becek banget.

01:32:12.460 --> 01:32:13.461
Bagus.

01:32:16.264 --> 01:32:17.265
Masuk.

01:32:18.332 --> 01:32:19.367
Sempit banget.

01:32:22.136 --> 01:32:25.973
Gimana? Enak. Kamu ngerasa enak?

01:32:28.042 --> 01:32:29.043
Gede banget.

01:32:29.410 --> 01:32:30.411
Mau keluar.

01:32:40.721 --> 01:32:41.756
Duh, gimana nih.

01:32:44.825 --> 01:32:46.360
Enak banget.

01:32:46.694 --> 01:32:48.229
Sambil ngenyot tetekmu sendiri.

01:32:58.873 --> 01:32:59.874
Enak banget.

01:33:03.477 --> 01:33:04.512
Aku juga ngerasa enak.

01:33:05.313 --> 01:33:06.314
Udah nggak kuat.

01:33:07.148 --> 01:33:09.650
Aku juga mau keluar.

01:33:15.323 --> 01:33:16.691
Sempit banget jepitnya.

01:33:20.861 --> 01:33:21.862
Keluarin di perut.

01:33:28.135 --> 01:33:29.470
Keluar banyak banget.

01:33:34.141 --> 01:33:35.242
Liat sini mukanya.

01:33:35.910 --> 01:33:37.745
Coba liat sendiri kayak gitu.

01:33:38.379 --> 01:33:40.948
Coba sentuh.

01:33:54.061 --> 01:34:00.034
Gimana? Udah dikeluarin banyak di dalem. Seneng? Enak kan?

01:34:01.402 --> 01:34:02.403
Baguslah.

01:34:03.604 --> 01:34:04.105
Nih.

01:34:04.472 --> 01:34:05.473
Ayo keluarin.

01:34:07.208 --> 01:34:08.209
Makasih ya.

01:34:19.186 --> 01:34:20.888
Untung gue sangean.

01:34:23.924 --> 01:34:25.159
Maaf ya. Makasih banyak.

01:34:25.593 --> 01:34:26.594
Gue juga.

01:34:27.461 --> 01:34:29.497
Tadi mantap banget lho.

01:34:30.264 --> 01:34:31.265
Syukurlah kalau gitu.

01:34:42.376 --> 01:34:55.756
Mikuni. Mikuni. Di mana lo?

01:34:59.660 --> 01:35:00.661
Di mana sih lo?

01:35:09.503 --> 01:35:28.656
Mikuni. Ada apa?

01:35:52.913 --> 01:35:58.819
Di tempat kayak begini. Malah nyalain mesin segala. Kenapa?

01:36:12.032 --> 01:36:17.404
Mikuni. Kenapa?

01:36:25.579 --> 01:36:27.214
Lagi mainin perut ya?

01:36:54.341 --> 01:36:55.342
Enak kan?

01:36:57.111 --> 01:36:58.612
Segitunya banget ya mainin kontol lo?

01:37:00.247 --> 01:37:01.549
Kan baru aja gue kasih?

01:37:23.237 --> 01:37:31.378
Boleh deh. Enak kan?

01:37:32.546 --> 01:37:36.116
Coba lihat.

01:37:44.959 --> 01:38:12.887
Bilang ya kalau mau keluar. Enak kan?

01:38:19.593 --> 01:38:20.594
Gimana?

01:38:28.669 --> 01:38:30.404
Udah muncrat banyak banget nih di perut.

01:38:36.243 --> 01:38:39.380
Gerakinnya lebih kencang lagi ya.

01:38:44.952 --> 01:38:45.953
Gitu.

01:38:49.556 --> 01:38:50.858
Bilang kalau mau keluar.

01:39:43.210 --> 01:39:51.218
Bilang kalau mau keluar.

01:40:10.304 --> 01:40:27.521
Berdiri di sini. Lo suka ditekan kan?

01:40:30.190 --> 01:40:31.592
Gitu.

01:40:36.530 --> 01:40:37.931
Terus.

01:40:47.941 --> 01:40:49.343
Iya, gitu.

01:40:49.676 --> 01:40:50.978
Lakuin kayak gitu.

01:40:53.080 --> 01:41:13.734
Iya. Gitu. Coba lakuin. Gimana?

01:41:16.103 --> 01:41:17.304
Tempelin ya.

01:41:19.873 --> 01:41:28.682
Banyak banget. Kalau mau keluar gimana?

01:41:37.391 --> 01:41:38.492
Coba berdiri di sini.

01:41:40.828 --> 01:42:17.698
Bagus. Terusin. Coba keluarin sekali lagi. Gimana?

01:42:41.188 --> 01:42:42.189
Gimana?

01:43:50.557 --> 01:43:52.492
Enak, kan?

01:44:22.089 --> 01:44:22.623
Kenapa?

01:44:32.566 --> 01:44:32.866
Senyum dong. Gimana?

01:44:37.704 --> 01:44:42.743
Penampilan memalukan apaan nih. Kenapa?

01:44:47.514 --> 01:44:51.685
Tadi di luar seru ya abis ngelakuin macem-macem?

01:44:53.520 --> 01:44:54.688
Kerasa banget, hah?

01:44:59.493 --> 01:45:01.061
Lo senyum terus dari tadi.

01:45:01.261 --> 01:45:09.036
Seseru itu ya? Lagi ngeraba apaan lo?

01:45:15.542 --> 01:45:16.543
Kenapa?

01:45:17.144 --> 01:45:18.312
Pake coli segala lagi.

01:45:29.656 --> 01:45:31.591
Apaan sih. Suara lo manja banget.

01:45:32.592 --> 01:45:39.933
Mau diapain sih? Elus? Mau dielus?

01:45:41.468 --> 01:45:42.469
Tapi liat nih.

01:45:44.671 --> 01:45:47.007
Selain yang berkepentingan dilarang masuk.

01:45:47.708 --> 01:45:48.709
Ini buat gue ya?

01:45:50.277 --> 01:45:52.813
Berarti cuma gue yang boleh kan.

01:45:54.081 --> 01:45:56.550
"Dilarang masuk". Lepasin.

01:45:58.985 --> 01:46:03.990
Lo sendiri yang lepas. Mau disentuh, kan?

01:46:08.729 --> 01:46:09.730
Di sini.

01:46:26.880 --> 01:46:28.081
Udah lepas?

01:46:30.150 --> 01:46:31.151
Kayaknya mau lepas.

01:46:32.285 --> 01:46:33.720
Bakal gue hajar pelan-pelan.

01:46:35.722 --> 01:46:45.031
Kasih liat telinga lo juga. Geli banget ya? Kenapa?

01:47:00.447 --> 01:47:01.448
Enak, kan?

01:47:06.219 --> 01:47:49.930
Hmm. Terus mau diapain lagi?

01:47:53.333 --> 01:47:55.268
Lagi dong.

01:47:56.069 --> 01:47:57.270
Mau ditambah lagi?

01:48:04.010 --> 01:48:16.756
Pelan-pelan. Lo suka yang sakit juga, kan?

01:48:56.129 --> 01:48:58.098
Bagus juga toket lo.

01:49:01.368 --> 01:49:02.469
Udah sering banget.

01:49:08.842 --> 01:49:11.211
Tetek yang bagus.

01:49:39.039 --> 01:49:41.241
Enak banget.

01:50:01.861 --> 01:50:06.733
Enak banget... Sakit.

01:50:08.868 --> 01:50:10.503
Lu jadi sensitif banget ya.

01:50:12.939 --> 01:50:14.841
Mainin lagi bagian itu sendiri.

01:50:19.879 --> 01:50:20.880
Begitu.

01:50:21.448 --> 01:50:22.949
Buka dan perlihatkan ke gue.

01:50:30.256 --> 01:50:42.902
Buka sendiri. Lu mau gue liat, kan?

01:50:45.805 --> 01:50:46.806
Di sini.

01:50:56.116 --> 01:50:58.718
Lu suka di dalem, kan?

01:51:08.662 --> 01:51:10.597
Gue masukin dua jari sekarang.

01:51:11.831 --> 01:51:13.600
Enak banget.

01:51:37.691 --> 01:51:47.267
Liat deh. Lu mau diapain?

01:51:48.334 --> 01:51:49.769
Ayo bilang.

01:51:51.571 --> 01:51:53.006
Mau berhenti.

01:51:57.811 --> 01:52:35.248
Angkat kakinya lebar-lebar. Mau dipeluk?

01:52:52.632 --> 01:52:53.633
Sini.

01:53:12.752 --> 01:53:14.120
Kayak gini.

01:53:37.410 --> 01:53:38.745
Liatin muka cantik lu.

01:53:39.445 --> 01:53:41.181
Duduk di sini.

01:53:50.657 --> 01:53:55.128
Ini yang lu mau, kan?

01:54:16.816 --> 01:54:18.585
Belum bilang 'selamat makan', lho.

01:54:20.687 --> 01:54:21.754
Selamat makan.

01:54:23.423 --> 01:54:37.337
Enak, kan? Gimana rasanya?

01:54:41.574 --> 01:54:42.842
Udah sesuai sama ajaran lu belum?

01:55:34.127 --> 01:55:35.428
Kenapa? Lu mau?

01:55:36.596 --> 01:55:37.597
Pantatnya mana?

01:55:38.398 --> 01:55:40.900
Memek. Lu mau memek lu diapain?

01:55:43.736 --> 01:56:04.490
Nungging deh. Nah. Kalo ini gimana?

01:56:04.724 --> 01:56:06.059
Enak banget.

01:56:07.260 --> 01:56:09.529
Lebih nungging lagi.

01:56:13.399 --> 01:56:14.701
Enak banget.

01:56:16.235 --> 01:56:17.236
Begitu.

01:56:28.281 --> 01:56:29.549
Liatin muka lu.

01:56:37.423 --> 01:56:38.424
Tuh kan.

01:56:55.708 --> 01:57:05.852
Kalo udah keluar baru gue masukin. Udah keluar?

01:57:35.148 --> 01:57:38.551
Oke. Madep sini.

01:57:48.761 --> 01:57:50.063
Mau banget.

01:57:50.730 --> 01:58:08.815
Mau, kan? Sip. Gue masukin ya. Kerasa?

01:58:30.636 --> 01:58:38.611
Kenapa?

01:58:38.744 --> 01:58:41.747
Pengen, ya? Kenapa sih?

01:59:30.463 --> 01:59:31.864
Nah, gitu.

01:59:47.313 --> 01:59:50.116
Di sini.

02:00:15.975 --> 02:00:46.973
Gue mainin tetek lu ya. Gimana?

02:00:51.344 --> 02:00:53.079
Enak banget, kan.

02:01:03.856 --> 02:01:05.725
Coba jilat leher gue.

02:01:07.193 --> 02:01:08.761
Rasain kekuatan gue.

02:01:10.062 --> 02:01:11.230
Ayo jilat.

02:01:14.533 --> 02:01:16.002
Sisi satunya. Sebelah sana.

02:01:17.003 --> 02:01:17.970
Begitu.

02:01:24.310 --> 02:01:26.579
Masukin lebih dalem lagi.

02:01:44.230 --> 02:01:45.231
Iya.

02:01:47.733 --> 02:01:51.871
Pasin ke bagian yang enak. Gue juga ngerasa enak banget. Mantap?

02:01:52.204 --> 02:01:53.539
Pasin ke tempat yang enak dong.

02:02:03.082 --> 02:02:06.252
Coba pasin ke tempat yang enak. Di sini, kan?

02:02:16.195 --> 02:02:17.196
Bener.

02:02:39.785 --> 02:02:40.786
Di sini.

02:02:54.533 --> 02:03:26.165
Keluarin aja. Ayok keluarin. Udah tenang?

02:03:27.333 --> 02:03:32.004
Tolol banget. Suka dari belakang?

02:03:33.539 --> 02:03:34.540
Suka banget.

02:03:34.907 --> 02:03:35.908
Dari belakang.

02:03:45.651 --> 02:03:53.659
Enak banget.

02:03:56.562 --> 02:03:57.563
Nah, gitu.

02:04:09.775 --> 02:04:40.372
Liatin mukanya. Sini liat muka lu. Di sini?

02:05:12.571 --> 02:05:16.542
Oke. Kenapa?

02:05:26.485 --> 02:05:42.701
Coba madep sini. Boleh, kan?

02:05:47.106 --> 02:05:49.742
Enak banget, anjing.

02:06:16.802 --> 02:06:20.139
Ah. Tuh kan. Jadi belepotan peju gini, kan?

02:06:28.280 --> 02:06:33.085
Liat muka lo. Peju itu mau diapain?

02:06:37.289 --> 02:06:38.290
Bagus.

02:06:40.559 --> 02:06:42.194
Peju milik Tuanmu.

02:06:45.097 --> 02:07:02.681
Bersihin. Gimana rasa kontol ini?

02:07:02.681 --> 02:07:04.617
Enak banget.

02:07:05.351 --> 02:07:14.660
Abis main macem-macem tadi,
Kan ini kontol gue. Kerasa banget, kan?

02:07:17.463 --> 02:07:17.896
Lagi.

02:07:18.197 --> 02:07:19.832
Udah keluar berkali-kali.

02:07:20.799 --> 02:07:23.102
Keluar juga ya? Manis banget sih lo.

02:07:24.370 --> 02:07:26.505
Main ke Tokyo lagi ya. Iya.

02:07:29.308 --> 02:07:33.012
Kalo udah balik, jadi ibu rumah tangga yang bener, layanin laki lo.

02:07:33.545 --> 02:07:34.513
Iya.
